# Content pipeline (MD → JSON)

## Sources (whitelist, project root)

| MD | Route |
|----|-------|
| `main.md` | `/` (home sections) |
| `games.md` | `/games` |
| `rewards.md` | `/rewards` |
| `resorts.md` | `/resorts` |
| `first-day-tips.md` | `/first-day-tips` |
| `faq.md` | `/faq` |
| `terms.md` | `/terms` |
| `privacy.md` | `/privacy` |

`README.md`, `ROUTE_HANDLERS_MIGRATION.md`, and `figma-plugin-export-tokens/README.md` are **not** parsed.

## Workflow

1. Edit the relevant `*.md` in the project root.
2. Run `npm run sync:content`.
3. Commit both MD and generated `src/app/data/*.json`.

**Do not** hand-edit `src/app/data/*.json` — they are generated.

## Output layout

```
src/app/data/siteMeta.json
src/app/data/dataCasinoIntro.json   ← H1 short title + preamble
src/app/data/dataLast.json          ← Resorts vs Online
src/app/data/dataSupport.json       ← What Actually Sets the Two Formats Apart
src/app/data/dataCasinoInfo.json    ← Who Each Format Actually Suits
src/app/data/dataAfterFaq.json      ← Responsible Gambling
src/app/data/dataFaq.json           ← Frequently Asked Questions
src/app/data/dataApp.json           ← unused (empty)
src/app/data/dataAfterSupport.json  ← unused (empty)
src/app/data/dataFooter.json
src/app/data/pages/{slug}.json      ← subpages
```

## Home mapping (`main.md`)

| `main.md` | JSON | Home section |
|---|---|---|
| `#` + preamble | `dataCasinoIntro` | CasinoIntroSection (one block) |
| `## Resorts vs Online` | `dataLast` | LastSection |
| `## What Actually Sets the Two Formats Apart` | `dataSupport` | SupportSection |
| `## Who Each Format Actually Suits` | `dataCasinoInfo` | CasinoInfoSection (intro + two text blocks) |
| `## Responsible Gambling` | `dataAfterFaq` | InfoSectionAfterFaq (intro + H3 tabs, not swiper) |
| `## Frequently Asked Questions` | `dataFaq` | FaqSection |

Home does not render AppSection or InfoSectionAfterSupport. TopCasino / TopGames / BonusSection are not from MD.

FAQ headings match `FAQ` or `Frequently Asked Questions` (`isFaqSection`). Nested `### Frequently Asked Questions` (e.g. `rewards.md`) is lifted into `data.faq`.

## Meta in MD

- `**Title:**` / `**Description:**` at top → `meta.title` / `meta.description`
- Home hero h1: `#` heading in `main.md` → `siteMeta.h1`
- Subpage h1: `#` heading, or first `##` when no `#`
- Subpage h2: part of `h1` before ` - `

## Language

Site language is fixed `en` (`<html lang="en">`). No locale/geo routing.

## Page layouts (`StaticRichPage`)

| variant | Pages | Blocks |
|---------|-------|--------|
| `header` | games, rewards, resorts, first-day-tips | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → sections → FAQ accordion |
| `footer-legal` | terms, privacy | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → sections |
| `footer-faq` | faq | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → FaqAccordionList |

Nested `###` / `####` inside a `##` section become `{ type: "heading", level: 3|4 }` in `section.content`.
